<title>USA: Organogenesis declares 25-pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Organogenesis declares 25-pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Organogenesis Inc said Monday it declared a 25 percent common stock dividend to be distributed on May 2 to shareholders of record on April 25.</p>
<p>One share of Common Stock will be issued for every four shares owned and no fractional shares will be issued, the company said.</p>
